<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait December air cargo volume up 14 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Kuwait December air cargo volume up 14 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait airport cargo volume rose 14 percent to 11,995 tonnes in December compared with the same period in 1995, the civil avaition authority said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The number of passengers using the Kuwait airport rose five percent to 286,359 in December, figures released by the Directorate General of Civil Aviation showed.</p>
<p>Kuwait Airways Corp carried 75 percent of cargo and 63 percent of passengers.</p>
<p>The airport handled 2,750 flights during the month compared with 2,657 flights in December 1995.</p>
</text>
